1
00:00:00,031 --> 00:00:02,411
(Vet:)Here are a few warning
signs to look out for.

2
00:00:02,567 --> 00:00:05,107
(Vet:)If you see any of them,
don't hesitate to call.

3
00:00:05,269 --> 00:00:08,109
(Raj:)Thank you for taking such
good care of my little girl.

4
00:00:08,272 --> 00:00:10,222
(Vet:)My pleasure.
Have a nice night.

5
00:00:10,375 --> 00:00:12,045
(Leonard:)Yes, thank you for all your help.

6
00:00:12,210 --> 00:00:14,190
(Penny:)Yeah. I'm sorry if you didn't think
we were taking it seriously.

7
00:00:14,345 --> 00:00:16,915
(Penny:)-We love animals.
-Do you guys own any pets?

8
00:00:17,081 --> 00:00:19,621
(Sheldon:)-No.
-Good.

9
00:00:26,691 --> 00:00:28,531
(Howard:)I love you so much.

10
00:00:28,693 --> 00:00:30,103
(Bernadette:)I love you, too.

11
00:00:38,403 --> 00:00:40,443
(Amy:)-Sorry.
-Sorry.

12
00:00:41,239 --> 00:00:43,049
(Man:)You guys missed
a pretty great time.

13
00:00:43,207 --> 00:00:46,377
(Sheldon:)The conductor and I have
the same pocket watch.

14
00:00:48,312 --> 00:00:51,482
(Man:)-It was crazy.
-Dare I say "loco?"

15
00:00:52,550 --> 00:00:53,960
(Sheldon:)Oh, and, Amy, guess what?

16
00:00:54,118 --> 00:00:55,898
(Sheldon:)The conductor said as
soon as he gets off work,

17
00:00:56,054 --> 00:01:00,024
(Sheldon:)he can come back to the bed and
breakfast and play his banjo for us.

